<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	10.75 /10.675  11.10 /11.00   11.35 /11.25</p>
<p>BPI			10.80 /10.675  11.20 /11.15   11.625/11.55</p>
<p>Citibank		 10.75 /10.675  11.25 /11.15   11.625/11.475</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	  10.80 /10.70   11.225/11.125  11.575/11.45</p>
<p>Metrobank		10.725/10.625  11.30 /11.15   11.675/11.375</p>
<p>Multinational	  10.70 /10.625  11.15 /11.00   11.65 /11.475</p>
<p>PCIBank		  10.69 /10.675  11.25 /11.05   11.55 /11.35</p>
<p>PNB			10.75 /10.65   11.20 /11.10   11.55 /11.45</p>
<p>Security Bank	  10.90 /10.675  11.40 /11.15   11.75 /11.45</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   10.695/10.60   11.10 /11.00   11.40 /11.30</p>
<p>SolidBank		10.720/10.680  11.225/11.175  11.60 /11.50</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
